<section class="home-dashboard__stats" aria-label="Indicadores principales">

    <article class="home-dashboard__stat home-dashboard__stat--teal">
        <div class="home-dashboard__stat-top"><span>Total de pedimentos</span><span class="home-dashboard__icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span></div>
        <strong>1,282</strong><small>Registros acumulados</small>
        <div class="home-dashboard__track"><span style="width: 85%"></span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="home-dashboard__stat home-dashboard__stat--amber">
        <div class="home-dashboard__stat-top"><span>En proceso</span><span class="home-dashboard__icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></div>
        <strong>146</strong><small>Pendientes de concluir</small>
        <div class="home-dashboard__track"><span style="width: 45%"></span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="home-dashboard__stat home-dashboard__stat--green">
        <div class="home-dashboard__stat-top"><span>Completados</span><span class="home-dashboard__icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div>
        <strong>1,084</strong><small>Procesos finalizados</small>
        <div class="home-dashboard__track"><span style="width: 80%"></span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="home-dashboard__stat home-dashboard__stat--red">
        <div class="home-dashboard__stat-top"><span>Con incidencias</span><span class="home-dashboard__icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span></div>
        <strong>52</strong><small>Requieren revisión</small>
        <div class="home-dashboard__track"><span style="width: 25%"></span></div>
    </article>
</section>

<section class="home-dashboard__main-grid">
    <article class="home-dashboard__panel">
        <div class="home-dashboard__panel-heading">
            <div><h2>Actividad de pedimentos</h2><p>Resumen mensual de ejemplo</p></div>
            <span class="home-dashboard__tag">Últimos 6 meses</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-dashboard__legend"><span><i class="home-dashboard__legend-dot home-dashboard__legend-dot--teal"></i>Completados</span><span><i class="home-dashboard__legend-dot home-dashboard__legend-dot--light"></i>En proceso</span></div>
        <div class="home-dashboard__chart" role="img" aria-label="Gráfica ilustrativa de actividad mensual">
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Mayo</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:63%"></i></div><b>75</b></div>
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Junio</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:77%"></i></div><b>92</b></div>
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Julio</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:70%"></i></div><b>84</b></div>
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Agosto</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:92%"></i></div><b>110</b></div>
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Septiembre</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:82%"></i></div><b>98</b></div>
            <div class="home-dashboard__chart-row"><span>Octubre</span><div class="home-dashboard__bar-track"><i style="width:100%"></i></div><b>120</b></div>
        </div>
    </article>

    <article class="home-dashboard__panel">
        <div class="home-dashboard__panel-heading"><div><h2>Estado general</h2><p>Distribución ilustrativa</p></div></div>
        <div class="home-dashboard__statuses">
            <div><div class="home-dashboard__status-label"><span>Completados</span><b>84.6%</b></div><div class="home-dashboard__status-track"><i class="home-dashboard__fill--green" style="width:84.6%"></i></div></div>
            <div><div class="home-dashboard__status-label"><span>En proceso</span><b>11.4%</b></div><div class="home-dashboard__status-track"><i class="home-dashboard__fill--teal" style="width:11.4%"></i></div></div>
            <div><div class="home-dashboard__status-label"><span>Con incidencias</span><b>4%</b></div><div class="home-dashboard__status-track"><i class="home-dashboard__fill--red" style="width:4%"></i></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-dashboard__note"><strong>Resumen del sistema</strong><p>Esta sección puede mostrar alertas, pendientes o información prioritaria para el administrador.</p></div>
    </article>
</section>

<section class="home-dashboard__panel home-dashboard__recent">
    <div class="home-dashboard__panel-heading"><div><h2>Actividad reciente</h2><p>Registros de demostración; sustituye estos datos por los reales.</p></div></div>
    <div class="home-dashboard__table-wrap">
        <table class="home-dashboard__table">
            <thead><tr><th>Identificador</th><th>Descripción</th><th>Estado</th><th>Actualización</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td><strong>PED-2026-1042</strong></td><td>Pedimento de importación</td><td><span class="home-dashboard__badge home-dashboard__badge--green">Completado</span></td><td>Recientemente</td></tr>
                <tr><td><strong>PED-2026-1041</strong></td><td>Pedimento de exportación</td><td><span class="home-dashboard__badge home-dashboard__badge--amber">En proceso</span></td><td>Recientemente</td></tr>
                <tr><td><strong>PED-2026-1040</strong></td><td>Revisión documental</td><td><span class="home-dashboard__badge home-dashboard__badge--red">Incidencia</span></td><td>Recientemente</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
